WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:16.676
Ce week-end, je vais voir ma grand-mère à Lyon.
This weekend I'm going to see my grandmother in Lyon.

2
00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:19.532
Tu vas prendre le train ?
Are you going to take the train?

3
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:24.428
Oui, je pars vendredi soir et je reviens dimanche.
Yes, I'm leaving Friday evening and coming back Sunday.

4
00:00:24.528 --> 00:00:29.300
Moi, je vais rester à la maison et regarder des séries.
I'm going to stay at home and watch series.

5
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.460
Quel programme ! Et la semaine prochaine ?
What a programme! And next week?

6
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.996
La semaine prochaine, je vais travailler beaucoup.
Next week I'm going to work a lot.
